{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":58919,"duration_api_ms":60497,"ttft_ms":13272,"ttft_stream_ms":1614,"time_to_request_ms":58,"num_turns":3,"result":"{\"verdict\":\"REVISE\",\"blockers\":[\"“compare cycle”未给出可复现的量化定义（按自然日、按迭代次数、还是按 admission_operation 计次?），导致\\\"连续30个完成的compare cycle\\\"这一切换门槛无法被确定性验收脚本实现或审计。\",\"代码层隔离仅依赖 CI 静态 rg/import 检查，属于提交前静态门禁，无法阻止运行时通过反射、动态导入、monkeypatch 或间接转发调用 PendingResearchInputStore.claim/consume、QueueIdeationService 写方法、set_spec_status；未定义任何运行时守卫机制。\",\"reconciler 在 admission_attempt 与 pending 两次写入之间崩溃时，未定义当 pending slot 记录与 admission history 状态冲突时的确定性优先规则，可能导致补写孤儿 admission。\",\"closure 优先级仅描述同一次 reconciliation 内多候选的顺序，但未明确禁止已写入的 policy_budget/external_block_exhausted closure 被事后出现的 evidence_backed 候选覆盖或升级。\"],\"required_changes\":[\"精确定义 compare cycle 的边界与计数单位，并给出该批次的确定性起止事件，使 30 cycle 门槛可由脚本自动核验。\",\"为运行时隔离增加代码层强制机制（而非仅 CI 静态扫描），例如给 lifecycle 模块的依赖对象加运行时不可变代理/权限令牌，缺少令牌时对写方法调用直接抛异常。\",\"明确 reconciler 在 pending/history 状态冲突时的确定性优先规则（例如以 pending store 的 lease/nonce 为唯一真源），并给出对应冲突测试。\",\"显式声明 terminal closure 一旦写入不可被更晚出现的更高优先级候选覆盖或升级，append_closure() 幂等语义需覆盖这一点并补充测试。\"],\"tests\":[{\"test_name\":\"test_append_closure_idempotent_no_override\",\"input\":\"question 已有 closure(policy_budget, not_validated)；随后收到迟到的 evidence_backed 候选写入\",\"expected\":\"append_closure 返回原有 policy_budget closure 事件，不生成新 closure，账本仅一条 terminal closure\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_closure_priority_when_multiple_candidates_same_reconciliation\",\"input\":\"同一 reconciliation 周期内 evidence_backed 与 policy_budget 候选同时满足\",\"expected\":\"写入 evidence_backed closure，policy_budget 候选被丢弃且不产生额外事件\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_revision_budget_exhausted_requires_reframe_before_policy_budget_closure\",\"input\":\"lineage 的 revision_budget 已耗尽但 reframe_budget 未耗尽\",\"expected\":\"派生状态为 REFRAME_REQUIRED，不产生 policy_budget closure\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_validated_label_requires_holdout_final_run_id\",\"input\":\"closure_claim=validated 但 closure 事件缺少 holdout_final_run_id 字段\",\"expected\":\"确定性校验器拒绝写入，报错缺少 holdout_final_run_id\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_pending_slot_occupied_no_admission_generated\",\"input\":\"PASS 的 ClaimReview 尝试写入已被占用的 pending slot\",\"expected\":\"仅记录 admission_attempt，不生成 external_review_attempt 或 question_admission\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_reconciler_replay_zero_new_facts_on_second_run\",\"input\":\"reconciler 因崩溃重跑两次，账本状态相同\",\"expected\":\"第一次补写缺失的 admission 事实，第二次运行不产生任何新事件\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_lifecycle_module_cannot_call_pending_store_claim_at_runtime\",\"input\":\"lifecycle 服务代码尝试直接调用 PendingResearchInputStore.claim()\",\"expected\":\"运行时守卫抛出权限异常，调用被阻止（不仅是 CI 静态检查失败）\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_reframe_budget_cross_subquestion_accumulation\",\"input\":\"同一 lineage_id 下两个子问题各产生1次 reframe 事件，reframe_budget.max_per_lineage=2\",\"expected\":\"派生状态显示 reframe_budget 已耗尽，第三个子问题请求触发 REFRAME_REQUIRED 或 policy_budget closure 判定链\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_mode_transition_authoritative_to_off_rejected\",\"input\":\"配置从 research_lifecycle.mode=authoritative 尝试直接转换为 off\",\"expected\":\"转换被拒绝，报错必须先退到 compare\"},{\"test_name\":\"test_compare_cycle_boundary_deterministic_count\",\"input\":\"连续29个完成的compare cycle零差异后，第30个cycle出现一个字段差异\",\"expected\":\"自动 cutover gate 判定未达标，计数器重置，不允许 compare→authoritative\"}]}","stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"285870f5-12bf-4c35-80af-a3c523867dca","total_cost_usd":0.14659070000000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9454,"cache_read_input_tokens":18869,"output_tokens":5212,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9454,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2162,"cache_read_input_tokens":12598,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3127,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3127},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"model