的 revision_budget 已耗尽但 reframe_budget 未耗尽","expected":"派生状态为 REFRAME_REQUIRED，不产生 policy_budget closure"},{"test_name":"test_validated_label_requires_holdout_final_run_id","input":"closure_claim=validated 但 closure 事件缺少 holdout_final_run_id 字段","expected":"确定性校验器拒绝写入，报错缺少 holdout_final_run_id"},{"test_name":"test_pending_slot_occupied_no_admission_generated","input":"PASS 的 ClaimReview 尝试写入已被占用的 pending slot","expected":"仅记录 admission_attempt，不生成 external_review_attempt 或 question_admission"},{"test_name":"test_reconciler_replay_zero_new_facts_on_second_run","input":"reconciler 因崩溃重跑两次，账本状态相同","expected":"第一次补写缺失的 admission 事实，第二次运行不产生任何新事件"},{"test_name":"test_lifecycle_module_cannot_call_pending_store_claim_at_runtime","input":"lifecycle 服务代码尝试直接调用 PendingResearchInputStore.claim()","expected":"运行时守卫抛出权限异常，调用被阻止（不仅是 CI 静态检查失败）"},{"test_name":"test_reframe_budget_cross_subquestion_accumulation","input":"同一 lineage_id 下两个子问题各产生1次 reframe 事件，reframe_budget.max_per_lineage=2","expected":"派生状态显示 reframe_budget 已耗尽，第三个子问题请求触发 REFRAME_REQUIRED 或 policy_budget closure 判定链"},{"test_name":"test_mode_transition_authoritative_to_off_rejected","input":"配置从 research_lifecycle.mode=authoritative 尝试直接转换为 off","expected":"转换被拒绝，报错必须先退到 compare"},{"test_name":"test_compare_cycle_boundary_deterministic_count","input":"连续29个完成的compare cycle零差异后，第30个cycle出现一个字段差异","expected":"自动 cutover gate 判定未达标，计数器重置，不允许 compare→authoritative"}]},"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"50dc784c-07bc-4cb9-8ec6-64c4c1e8e8d2"}
